From: Asaad <assadelbadawy24@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:11:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat(monitoring): track LLM and retrieval health per
 request

Add agents/telemetry.py (contextvars, no-op outside a request). llm.generate
now reports model, latency and fallbacks; the retrieval adapter reports the
best distance and empty results. record_event stores these fields and the
dashboard stats gain error rate, p95 latency, LLM failure/fallback rate,
empty-retrieval rate and mean top-1 distance. The API logs one line per
chat (never the message text). Old log lines stay valid.
